Hello friends, we have not released updates for a long time and now we will start releasing them!
At the moment we are working on a game.
What is planned to add / change:
We plan to change the game system;
More new music for the game;
New achievements;
New levels;
There will be an available constructor;

According to statistics, many stop at level 4 and we decided to simplify the levels

Help us improve the game, offer your ideas
